     "html": "<p>Try to imagine Italy as a person lying down:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>the <b>Alps</b> are the <b>crown</b> (or hat) that protects the head;</li>\n<li>the <b>Apennines</b> are the <b>backbone</b>, running from head to feet;</li>\n<li>the <b>rivers</b> are the <b>veins</b> that carry water to the whole body;</li>\n<li>the <b>Po Plain</b> is the <b>belly</b>, where people \"eat\" (farming) and work the most;</li>\n<li><b>Calabria</b> is the toe of the boot, <b>Apulia</b> the heel, the <b>Gargano</b> the spur, and <b>Sicily</b> the ball that is about to be kicked!</li>\n</ul>"
